\]
where:
- \( I \) is the current through the coil,
- \( N \) is the number of turns in the coil,
- \( r \) is the radius of the coil,
- \( \mu_0 \) is the permeability of free space, which is approximately \( 4\pi \times 10^{-7} \, \text{T m/A} \).

